OL,4,BShevchenko lying about drugs test      
OL,5,Bclaims - Mudryk                        
OL,6,GMykhailo Mudryk has accused Ukraine    
OL,7,Glegend Andriy Shevchenko of lying      
OL,8,Gabout the circumstances surrounding    
OL,9,Gthe winger's positive drugs test as    
OL,10,Ghis dispute with the country's         
OL,11,Gfootball federation continues.         
OL,13,FTottenham Hotspur winger Mudryk, who   
OL,14,Fis on a season-long loan from Chelsea, 
OL,15,Fwas suspended from November 2024 to    
OL,16,FJuly 2026 after testing positive for   
OL,17,Fthe banned substance meldonium.        
